# Cloudflare Pages routing (this file replaces .htaccess — Pages ignores Apache config).
# Copied verbatim into dist/ by Vite. FIRST MATCH WINS.

# The admin panel used to be served from /admin/ on this domain. It is now its own Pages
# project, because a direct load or refresh of /admin/<route> fell through to the rule
# below and served the STOREFRONT's index.html — the wrong app. Nesting two SPAs behind
# one catch-all does not work on Pages the way it does under Apache.
#
# These keep old bookmarks working. External redirects, so they must be absolute URLs.
/admin      https://fluro-admin.pages.dev/       302
/admin/*    https://fluro-admin.pages.dev/:splat 302

# Storefront SPA fallback. Real files (assets, prerendered products/<id>/index.html,
# sitemap.xml, robots.txt) are served before this rule applies.
/*          /index.html                          200
